mary\n\nAn interpolation holding a ternary split across lines is reported as resolving to `any` / `unknown` when its alternate (after `:`) holds an object literal. Both branches return `string`. The same expression on one line is not reported, nor is the object literal in the consequent.\n\n### Version\n\n- `vize` 0.443.0 (npm, bundled `@typescript/typescript-darwin-arm64` 7.0.2)\n- Node v26.10.0, macOS arm64\n\n`vize check` reports no type errors for the same file.\n\n### Reproduction\n\n`vize.config.json`\n\n```json\n{\n  \"linter\": {\n    \"preset\": \"opinionated\",\n    \"typeAware\": true\n  }\n}\n```\n\n`tsconfig.json`\n\n```json\n{\n  \"compilerOptions\": {\n    \"target\": \"ESNext\",\n    \"module\": \"ESNext\",\n    \"moduleResolution\": \"bundler\",\n    \"strict\": true,\n    \"skipLibCheck\": true,\n    \"lib\": [\"ESNext\", \"DOM\"]\n  },\n  \"include\": [\"*.vue\", \"*.ts\"]\n}\n```\n\n`MultilineTernary.vue`\n\n```vue\n<script setup lang=\"ts\">\nconst t = (id: string, params?: Record<string, unknown>): string => id;\nconst flag = true;\nconst name = \"x\";\n</script>\n\n<template>\n  <!-- reported: the alternate holds an object literal, and the ternary spans lines -->\n  <p>{{\n    flag\n      ? t(\"a\")\n      : t(\"b\", { name })\n  }}</p>\n  <!-- not reported: the same expression on one line -->\n  <p>{{ flag ? t(\"a\") : t(\"b\", { name }) }}</p>\n  <!-- not reported: the object literal in the consequent -->\n  <p>{{\n    flag\n      ? t(\"b\", { name })\n      : t(\"a\")\n  }}</p>\n</template>\n```\n\n`vize lint --format plain MultilineTernary.vue`\n\n```\n  MultilineTernary.vue:10:5 warning type/no-unsafe-template-binding Template interpolation resolves to an unsafe `any` or `unknown` type\n```","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ubugeeei-prod/vize/issues/8754/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ubugeeei-prod/vize/issues/8754/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}